# 1. Ignore everything
**/*

# 2. Add files and directories that should be included
!apps/**
!libs/**
!infra/**
!deno.jsonc
!deno.lock

# 3. Bonus step: ignore any unnecessary files that may be inside those allowed directories in Step #2
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/node_modules
**/build
**/dist
**/Dockerfile
**/dockerfile
**/dockerfile.*
**/_fresh

# 4. Never let a secret into an image. On the server these folders hold the env file and the Web
#    Push key; Compose hands them to the containers at run time (env_file, a bind mount).
infra/envs
infra/configs
